    {
      "name": "core-service - brands",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List brands",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/brands", "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["brands"] },
            "description": "Administrador ve todas; el resto solo las suyas (dueño) o las de campañas donde participa."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create brand",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('brandId', body.id); }",
                  "if (body.connectUrl) { pm.collectionVariables.set('brandConnectUrl', body.connectUrl); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Marca de prueba\",\n  \"slug\": \"marca-de-prueba\",\n  \"allowedSocial\": [\"facebook\", \"instagram\", \"linkedin\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/brands", "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["brands"] },
            "description": "ownerId sale del JWT (user.sub), no del body. Requiere permiso marcas:crear (Cliente o Administrador en el seed). Requiere las 4 env vars de Ayrshare (AYRSHARE_API_KEY/DOMAIN/PRIVATE_KEY/API_BASE_URL) configuradas en core-service — sin ellas responde 500. La respuesta trae `connectUrl` (URL de onboarding para conectar redes en Ayrshare) pero NUNCA `refId`/`profileKey` (son internos, no se exponen). Abre `connectUrl` en el navegador para conectar de verdad una red social antes de probar el sync."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get brand by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/brands/{{brandId}}", "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["brands", "{{brandId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update brand",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Marca de prueba (editada)\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/brands/{{brandId}}", "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["brands", "{{brandId}}"] },
            "description": "BrandAccessGuard exige ser dueño de la marca (o Administrador)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete brand (soft delete)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": { "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/brands/{{brandId}}", "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["brands", "{{brandId}}"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "core-service - social accounts",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sync social accounts (Ayrshare)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/brands/{{brandId}}/social-accounts/sync",
              "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["brands", "{{brandId}}", "social-accounts", "sync"]
            },
            "description": "Consulta GET /user en Ayrshare (scoped al profileKey de la marca) y sincroniza SocialAccount local contra el catálogo de SocialNetwork. Prerrequisitos: 1) haber corrido `Create brand` (la marca necesita profileKey); 2) haber abierto la `connectUrl` devuelta y conectado de verdad al menos una red en Ayrshare; 3) que exista en `core-service - catalogos → Social Networks` un registro cuyo `code` coincida EXACTO con el identificador de Ayrshare (ej. `facebook`, `instagram`, `twitter`, `linkedin`, `tiktok`, `youtube`) — si no existe, esa red se ignora (se loguea un warning) en vez de fallar el sync completo. Requiere permiso marcas:editar."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List social accounts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/brands/{{brandId}}/social-accounts",
              "host": ["{{coreBaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["brands", "{{brandId}}", "social-accounts"]
            },
